From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:26:35 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: apple,macaudio: Add the J604 speakers

The MacBook Pro 14" M4 (J604) speakers: six SN012776 amps, two woofers
and a tweeter per side, on the AOP's speaker stream, the layout of the
J616s.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
index 2f83d4c126..c46ddf4ddf 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
           - apple,j274-macaudio
           - apple,j293-macaudio
           - apple,j314-macaudio
+          - apple,j604-macaudio
           - apple,j604-macaudio-jack
           - apple,j614-macaudio
           - apple,j614-macaudio-jack
